492 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (TBRe23 also met its target of high adjustability in vehicle set-up and dynamic response primarily through the introduction of anti-roll bars paired with Multimatic corner dampers. TBRe24 evolved upon these implementations, with the new structures developed building upon the understanding of previous years to improve reliability and functionality.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
493 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Overall, the secondary structures of the 2025 challenger will be a performance-orientated iteration of the suspension, steering, and brake systems of the vehicle thanks to the unparalleled amount of testing time and data acquired in 2024. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
494 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <>
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
495 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The 2025 season sees the return of TBReAI, our self-driving car project. While we hope to enter the full vehicle ADS class in future years, the decision has been taken to reduce the project scope for this year, and to focus on building a robust and reliable software system for the competition-provided DDT car.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
496 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (With the return of this project a lot of freedom in how we tackle technical challenges is available to us this year. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
497 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (From using a mixture of LiDAR and stereoscopic cameras to detect the track boundaries to using advanced modern simulation technologies to ensure that training models can be mapped onto reality.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
498 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We aim to compete in the trackdrive, skidpad and acceleration challenges in 2025.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
