/T (Motor Control With attention to a host of control tools, the team aims to unlock the full potential of its electric powertrain to deliver even more sustained power. Through the thorough characterisation of the motor, we can design and implement advanced, adaptive control to customise performance for Formula Student competitions. Techniques such as regenerative braking and advanced traction control will ensure that the system is being used to its fullest capabilities.)
